### SQLite & SQL Quick Cheatsheet

#### Querying:
```sql
-- Filter and order
SELECT id, title, created_at FROM sessions WHERE model_used = 'Groq' ORDER BY updated_at DESC LIMIT 10;

-- Aggregations
SELECT provider_id, COUNT(*) as query_count, SUM(total_tokens) as total_tok FROM model_usage GROUP BY provider_id;
```

#### Transactions & Performance:
```sql
-- Enable WAL mode for high concurrent read/write throughput
PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL;
PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;

-- Create indexes for fast lookup
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_sessions_updated ON sessions(updated_at DESC);
```
